<title>USA: Bank of New York says Renyl adds CEO post.</title>
<headline>Bank of New York says Renyl adds CEO post.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of New York Co Inc said on Tuesday that its directors had named Thomas Renyl, the company's president, to the added post of chief executive as of July 1.</p>
<p>Carter Bacot, the current chief executive, will continue to serve as chairman until his retirement in February, 1998, the bank holding company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
